WEBVTT

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:14.140
W-Water...

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:18.650
That's cold and feels good,

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:20.680
but I'd rather have it in a cup.

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:25.830
I feel alive again...

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:29.320
Huh?

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:30.730
Where is everyone?

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:32.670
<b>Joutou Business High School 

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:37.010
<b>JTB Big Culture Fair</b>

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:40.180
<b>Cotton Candy</b>

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:42.350
<b>Hero Show</b>

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.510
Come check us out!

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:46.690
<b>Oni-Hunting Game 
1:  Try    Yen</b>

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:48.560
Today's the last day, huh?

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:52.620
A lot's happened before, but it 
should end up just fine.

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:54.670
Are you sure?

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.020
What are you and President Kamiya planning?

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:05.620
<b>Big Culture Fair</b>

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:05.620
Well, if we can get through 
today, we'll be fine.

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:08.120
This is going pretty well, huh?

00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:11.260
The last day is always the most exciting!

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:12.540
These voices!

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:13.950
Hey, Inaba.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:15.840
You guys came...

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:59.400
<b>Twenty-fifth Haunting 
A Great Storm Blows</b>

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:00.270
Inaba, who are these people?

00:03:00.270 --> 00:03:01.600
He's cute.

00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:04.440
These two live in my apartment building.

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:05.650
Hi, there!

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:07.700
And this is my friend.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:08.870
Hey, there.

00:03:09.110 --> 00:03:13.010
So she's the one who makes 
those cute lunches?

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:16.900
Akine-chan only eats.

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:20.260
That's mean! I can make them, too!

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:22.630
Someone else makes the lunches.

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:25.700
You have a lot of friends, Inaba-kun!

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.420
I guess I do.

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:29.520
Hase-kun,

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:33.140
congratulations on being student council 
president two years in a row.

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:35.710
You still hear things fast, huh?

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:40.190
I've heard that you're getting along well 
with your student council president.

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:43.310
I can't lower my guard around you.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:46.490
I'm not as bad as you.

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:47.890
<i>What is that?</i>

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:51.760
Kids open up to each other fast, right?

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:54.750
Ta-ko's lucky to be friends with the hot guy!

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:58.790
I think dealing with someone 
like that would be exhausting.

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:02.210
It isn't just the three of you, is it?

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:03.660
Of course not!

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:06.260
Everyone else is having fun!

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:08.220
<b>Art Room</b>

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:13.150
Who's that?

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:15.050
He looks kinda scary.

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:16.950
He looks cool, though!

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:18.480
Not good enough...

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:21.440
You can do better than this!

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:22.600
Bring me a brush!

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:26.530
Now, where to start?

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:29.700
What's wrong?

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.050
I just saw the most beautiful woman.

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:33.850
Seriously?! Where? Where?

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:34.870
Huh?

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:36.580
Thank you.

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.500
Please take one with our child, too.

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:41.150
That's a great costume, huh?

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:45.720
Is that the school's mascot? 
Have you ever seen it before?

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:47.290
I don't think so...

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:50.300
I need the vegetables cut to make it in time!

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:51.990
Give me three yakisobas!

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:53.220
Hey!

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:56.290
Someone! Anyone... Help me!

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:01.320
Amazing!

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:03.850
I don't know who did that, but thank you!

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:12.400
The fact that it's a little undercooked

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:15.610
really makes it feel like some
students made it, and it's great.

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:26.190
Will this be okay?

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:28.970
They're all adults. You worry too much.

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:31.800
Don't say anything to ruin the festival fun.

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:33.820
You'll show us around, right?

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:34.730
Hase?

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:36.980
Yeah.

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:38.900
Then, where to, first?

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:38.900
<b>JTB Big Culture Fair Map</b>

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.810
What's your recommendation?

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:42.240
Hmm...

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:46.140
The Literature Club is showing 
off a novel they wrote...

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:50.330
The product of young folk's youthful 
fantasies and imaginations, huh?

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:52.750
I've gotta see that!

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.050
Isshiki-san!

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:57.480
We're having an eating contest 
at the food booths.

00:05:57.480 --> 00:05:59.210
Anyone is welcome to participate!

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:00.640
Come and try it out!

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:01.710
I'm there!

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:02.840
Akine-san?

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:05.270
What should we do, Inaba?

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:09.640
Let's just wander around.

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:10.510
Yeah.

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:12.760
<b>Takoyaki</b>

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:21.060
<b>Pancakes                            Takoyaki</b>

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:21.050
It's a little undercooked.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:23.330
Who cares? It's good!

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:24.750
Mom! There was a black thing! A black thing!

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:25.480
Right, right.

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:28.060
Bye-bye!

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:30.280
Come on, bring me more!

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:35.530
Spill your art on the canvas!

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:36.520
We will...

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:37.450
We'll spill it out!

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:39.370
Art is so violent!

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:44.340
You're Reimei Isshiki-sensei, aren't you?

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:47.430
I'm a fan. I have all your books.

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:48.870
Sign this, please!

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:50.810
Oh, my...

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:53.250
I'm happy, but I don't know what to say.

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:55.460
He's really popular.

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:58.450
What's the difference between 
Akira-san and him?

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:03.860
<i>Wow, this is just amazing!</i>

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:08.530
<b>JTB      Hot Dog Eating Contest</b>

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:07.310
<i>The girl with the ponytail, 
who joined at the last minute,</i>

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:08.520
<i>is wolfing them down!</i>

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:10.350
Give me more!

00:07:10.350 --> 00:07:13.060
<i>This is her fifteenth helping!</i>

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:14.690
We concede...

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:20.870
<b>JTB      Hot Dog Eating Contest</b>

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:17.900
<i>A champion is born!</i>

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:20.870
I wanted more...

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:23.770
How much can Akine-san eat?

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:27.300
I've never seen her full...

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:32.380
Antiquary!

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:35.170
Hey, are you two having fun?

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:36.530
What are you doing?

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:39.130
What else? Working.

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:42.210
How about picking something up?

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:46.120
Keraunos, the lightning of the gods, 
controlled by the great god Zeus.

00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:47.950
This is a fragment.

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:51.360
It will drive away evil and 
destroy your enemies.

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:53.820
It can also charge your phone.

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:55.650
How much?

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:00.080
You're buying it?

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:10.010
<i>These girls are the nominees 
for this year's Miss JTB!</i>

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:16.670
Huh?

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:19.060
Why? Why? Where's my light?!

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:21.610
<i>These are the four girls.</i>

00:08:22.220 --> 00:08:25.300
Mariko-san, they can't even see you.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:29.610
<b>Oni-Hunting Game 
1:  Try    Yen</b>

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:27.750
The oni-hunting game.

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:29.610
This is it, huh?

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:33.030
They think they can hunt us, huh?

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:35.070
Let's rip them apart.

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:36.790
Here, we go!

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:38.030
There, you are!

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:40.600
Hurry up!

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:42.230
The customers are waiting!

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:46.340
Why are we the targets?!

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:47.420
I don't know...

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:50.180
Somehow, it felt like we couldn't say no.

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:51.900
Hey, no talking!

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:54.110
There are lots of customers!

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:56.650
We saw a lot, huh?

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:58.760
Yeah. Where to, next?

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:02.490
Hey, did you hear that the president 
is planning something?

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:03.790
I sure did...

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:04.940
I can't wait!

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.690
What do you think she's gonna do?

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:10.760
President Kamiya, huh? Do you 
know what she's planning?

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:12.200
Nope.

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:14.090
I know!

00:09:14.090 --> 00:09:15.030
T-Tashiro!

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:16.700
Want to know? Do you?

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:19.190
But I won't tell you yet!

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:21.640
You're part of it, aren't you?

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:24.610
A lot is still ahead, huh?

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:26.880
Wait, there's no time for this!

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:28.520
Inaba, it's time!

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:29.830
The English Conversation Club!

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:31.750
That time already?

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.160
That's enough.

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:36.120
Don't do harmful things anymore!

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:40.000
None of your impudence, woman pirate.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:42.600
Nobody can stop me!

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.640
How amazing!

00:09:44.840 --> 00:09:49.190
The story recalls the famous 
lady pirates, Ann and Mary.

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:50.180
Wonderful.

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:52.770
I always cry at these things...

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:55.690
Wake up, my dearest sister!

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:58.360
What? He's backstage?

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:01.330
There's more to drama than 
standing on a stage.

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:04.050
But that's just like him!

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:08.120
He always works his hardest.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:11.220
I'm so tired...

00:10:12.140 --> 00:10:13.570
This is boring.

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:15.630
I hope it ends soon.

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:17.860
Is anything fun gonna happen?

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:19.720
Just as planned, then.

00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:24.180
We'll have the program in the gym last.

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:26.860
Do I have to?

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:27.620
Yes.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:29.930
Jeez, you're so stubborn.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.280
Fine.

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:32.810
Thank you.

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:58.130
<b>JTB Big Culture Fair</b>

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:57.500
<i>This concludes all of the 
culture fair's programs.</i>

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:00.470
<i>Good work, everyone!</i>

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:02.090
<b>JTB Culture Fair</b>

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:08.420
Finally, from the student council...

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:20.110
What was that?

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:23.070
It seems something bad has happened.

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:32.220
What's wrong?!

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:35.090
Inaba...

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:38.880
It looks like someone wants to mess with us.

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:44.300
It's useless. We can't fix it.

00:11:46.360 --> 00:11:48.590
Isn't there anything we can do?

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:52.080
But there's so much we prepared!

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:53.920
Tashiro...

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:03.160
You just need this fixed, right?

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:05.280
Yes, but...

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:09.630
To fix it, you'd have to use magic!

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:11.460
Magic.

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:12.980
Then...

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:16.260
Yushi-kun?

00:12:16.620 --> 00:12:18.520
Problems?

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:20.040
Now what?

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:22.420
Um...

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:24.340
Inaba-kun's friends?

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:26.710
Inaba, what's going on?

00:12:28.770 --> 00:12:30.380
Help me!

00:12:32.650 --> 00:12:33.810
That's what you get.

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:35.410
I feel great.

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:38.710
<i>Sorry for the wait, everyone.</i>

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:45.990
<i>The student council has prepared 
something special for you.</i>

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:49.500
<i>Well, then, please enjoy it!</i>

00:12:58.220 --> 00:12:59.460
Who is that?

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:13.230
Is that... Could it be?

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:16.400
Chiaki-sensei?

00:13:37.990 --> 00:13:39.670
Chiaki's a great singer!

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:41.210
He's as good as a pro!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:42.630
So cool!

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:45.400
It's thanks to everyone...

00:14:00.780 --> 00:14:02.400
That's our cue.

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:03.150
Let's go, Fool.

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:04.900
Yes, master!

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:06.190
The Tower, Ithaqua!

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:11.120
They're all getting excited!

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:12.200
Let's keep it going.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:13.840
Judgment, Brondis!

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:16.950
Wheel of Fortune, Norn!

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:19.690
Why do we have to do this?

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:21.080
I want to tell fortunes.

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:23.370
I hate physical labor!

00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:28.250
Are you all right, master?

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:29.300
Yeah.

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:32.180
Chiaki's amazing, though!

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:33.380
Yeah.

00:14:33.380 --> 00:14:36.380
I didn't know fascinating people 
that way was possible.

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:38.590
It's practically a type of magic power.

00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:40.150
Magic power?

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:41.340
Yeah.

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:43.170
A genius superman,

00:14:43.170 --> 00:14:47.070
with the power to turn yourself into 
something different than usual.

00:14:47.270 --> 00:14:52.630
People with that power just seem 
different than everyone else.

00:14:52.630 --> 00:14:55.490
So they fascinate others, no matter what.

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.910
You could call it charisma.

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:59.570
Charisma...

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:03.010
She may be right.

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:06.030
The world is a big place.

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:11.970
Chiaki! Chiaki!

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:13.230
Wow!

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:39.760
Now, master...

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:41.210
Time for the second song.

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:42.740
Yeah, I'm on it.

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:43.900
The Empress, Merower!

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:02.050
Yes!

00:16:02.050 --> 00:16:03.190
Great work, Yushi-kun.

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:08.480
Okay, enjoy the rest.

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:10.150
Where are you going?

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:11.940
I have work.

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:16.270
How come they're still doing it, 
after we broke it?

00:16:16.470 --> 00:16:18.640
Let's break it again.

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:19.580
Yeah!

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:21.300
I knew you'd come.

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:24.100
There are always kids like that!

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:28.320
Kids who put their energy 
into spoiling others' fun.

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:30.150
What a miserable way to spend your youth.

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:31.410
Poor guys.

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:32.500
What?!

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:34.210
You're picking a fight with us?

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:35.590
Wanna get killed?

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:39.180
Sorry, but my friend is hard at work now.

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:41.510
I won't let you through!

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:42.690
I'll show you!

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:46.600
Nice!

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:48.820
Okay, let's go, too.

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:52.330
Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:54.190
<i>This concludes the culture fair.</i>

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:54.190
Encore!

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:59.350
<b>JTB Culture Fair</b>

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:57.730
Encore! Encore!

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:57.750
<i>Everyone, let's give Chiaki-sensei 
a round of applause!</i>

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:01.270
No! No! Encore!

00:18:01.270 --> 00:18:02.510
One more song!

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:03.910
Chiaki's amazing!

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:05.420
I want to hear more!

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:09.340
Looks like they're all done.

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:15.630
If you still rely on this stuff, 
you've got a lot to learn.

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:18.450
This is the only thing a man needs to fight.

00:18:24.360 --> 00:18:26.490
Good work, Inaba.

00:18:28.970 --> 00:18:30.450
Give me a break.

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:33.090
Thank you, Chiaki-sensei.

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:35.510
This is the last time, 
student council president.

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:36.920
Of course.

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.210
Oh, right.

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:41.950
We have to thank Inaba-kun's friends.

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:43.440
Um...

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:45.340
Where did they go?

00:18:45.340 --> 00:18:47.260
I'll tell them.

00:18:47.260 --> 00:18:48.270
Will you?

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:50.160
They're handy to have around, aren't they?

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:53.550
Yeah, they sure are!

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:57.780
<b>JTB Big Culture Fair</b>

00:18:57.780 --> 00:18:59.450
I'm here, everyone!

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:00.550
Huh?

00:19:01.100 --> 00:19:03.280
Yeah, it's over.

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:04.700
Too bad.

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:06.010
You're late...

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:07.500
Man, that was fun!

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:09.940
Truly, that was something to see.

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:12.470
Let's go home and have a drink!

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:16.290
What's going on?!

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:16.300
<b>JTB Big Culture Fair</b>

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:17.880
<b>Fin</b>

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:20.390
Let me get a photo, Chiaki-sensei!

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:22.050
A selfie, please!

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:23.650
Let's go to karaoke!

00:19:23.650 --> 00:19:25.090
Sing again!

00:19:25.090 --> 00:19:27.470
Fine... Fine, so calm down.

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:29.440
<i>After the concert,</i>

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:32.320
<i>everyone's opinion of Chiaki changed.</i>

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:36.230
<i>It was just as the student 
council president wanted.</i>

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:42.910
You're really popular.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:44.110
Shut up.

00:19:44.110 --> 00:19:46.280
Jeez, I don't know how Tashiro

00:19:46.280 --> 00:19:48.540
found something that happened six years ago.

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:51.630
Did you sing at your old school?

00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:53.820
Just once.

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:56.210
Why didn't you turn her down?

00:19:57.230 --> 00:19:59.010
She got on her knees and begged.

00:19:59.520 --> 00:20:01.210
Please sing at the culture fair!

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:02.180
Please!

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:04.810
Until you agree, I will stay like this.

00:20:04.810 --> 00:20:06.460
It was a threat.

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:09.880
That's so manly!

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:11.450
It isn't funny!

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:15.360
It was rough at my last school, too.

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:17.240
"I love you. Please date me."

00:20:17.240 --> 00:20:19.730
What's wrong with being popular?

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:21.460
It was an all-boys' school.

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:27.080
<i>And there was another change.</i>

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:31.740
Where should we have Chiaki-chan sing next?

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:33.670
The Christmas party?

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:35.330
The New Year's party?

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:36.910
Don't go overboard.

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:42.370
Aoki-sensei, your reading 
today was wonderful!

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:43.680
Thank you.

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:46.480
I want to be like you, too.

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:49.590
Then, let's practice together.

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:50.770
Okay!

00:20:57.700 --> 00:21:01.200
<i>Aoki started ignoring us.</i>

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:03.770
Kind of disappointing, huh?

00:21:03.770 --> 00:21:05.350
I thought she was a saint.

00:21:05.350 --> 00:21:09.960
But now, she's ignoring the 
people she can't control?

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:12.950
I guess even Aoki has another side.

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:14.630
What's wrong with that?

00:21:14.630 --> 00:21:15.750
Chiaki-chan?

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:19.040
I'm relieved to see a part of her is human.

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:20.540
Yeah.

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:23.130
<i>Second semester,</i>

00:21:23.150 --> 00:21:28.290
<i>in which I met JTB's two famous teachers, 
Chiaki and Aoki, ended all right.</i>

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:30.570
December's the running month, chirp!

00:21:30.570 --> 00:21:32.090
Teachers run, chirp!

00:21:32.090 --> 00:21:33.950
It's monks that run, chirp!

00:21:33.950 --> 00:21:35.320
Which is it, chirp?

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:38.980
Chirpity-chirp! Chirp!

00:23:10.730 --> 00:23:15.020
Hey, what future waits for us?

00:23:15.020 --> 00:23:17.540
Hmph, asking that isn't like you.

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:19.490
Everyone... Eat. Drink.

00:23:19.490 --> 00:23:20.540
Have a ton of fun!

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:22.710
This will never change!

00:23:25.070 --> 00:23:25.950
Right?

00:23:26.640 --> 00:23:29.170
Next time, the final episode:

00:23:29.170 --> 00:23:32.420
Elegant Yokai Apartment Life.

00:23:29.170 --> 00:23:32.430
<b>Twenty-sixth Haunting 
Elegant Yokai Apartment Life</b>

00:23:32.420 --> 00:23:35.660
The Yokai Apartments really are the best!
